  "description": "A grid-powered chamber for final thermal disposal. Reclaim fresh humanlike bodies at a deathstill first, then choose burial, a memorial casket, or disposal here. A separate cleanup bill accepts rotten and otherwise unreclaimable organic bodies without yielding water. New bills require explicit permission for colonists and other non-hostiles. Strip equipment you wish to retain first. Consumes 250 W; produces heat, never water or power. The disposal method is a game adaptation, not a canonical Fremen rite.",
